      "id": "la-ch07-item-1-1-1",
      "sourceStart": 546,
      "sourceEnd": 710,
      "original": "#### 1.1.1. <span style=\"color: red\">(Adjoint operator)</span> Suppose $T\\in\\mathcal{L}(V,W)$. The **adjoint** of $T$ is the function $T^*:W\\rightarrow V$ such that",
