    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch07-item-1-1-2",
      "sourceStart": 929,
      "sourceEnd": 1089,
      "original": "#### 1.1.2. <span style=\"color: red\">(Conjugate transpose)</span> Let $A\\in F^{m\\times n}$. Then the **conjugate transpose** $A^*$ of $A$ is defined as follows.",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
